	"Game-Faction-Russia-Desc": "Russia: Tesla Techology\nUnits:\n  • Tesla Tank\n  • Tesla Reactor (replaces Advanced Power Plant)\n\nPowers:\n  • Storm Troopers\n  • Parabombs\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Tesla Arcing\n\nBonuses:\n  • Tesla Coil (10% discount)\n  • Free Tesla Trooper Upgrade\n  • Kirov Tesla Bombs",
