	"Game-Faction-Shadow-Desc": "Shadow Sect: Stealth Technology\nUnits:\n  • Mobile Stealth Generator\n  • Spectre (replaces SSM)\n\nPowers:\n  • Shadow Team\n  • Stealth Tank Drop\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Heavy Stealth Tank\n\nBonuses:\n  • Comanche (10% discount)\n  • Stealth Generator (+4 passive range, remains cloaked during Tiberium Stealth)",
