	"Game-Faction-Traveler-Desc": "Traveler-59: Fast Attack\nUnits:\n  • Enervator\n  • Lacerator (replaces Seeker)\n\nPowers:\n  • Ion Surge\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Advanced Articulators\n\nBonuses:\n  • Fast Walkers (+15% Speed)",
	"Game-Faction-Traveler-Name": "Traveler-59",
	"Game-Faction-Ukraine-Desc": "Ukraine: Demolition\nUnits:\n  • V3 Launcher\n  • Siege Tank (replaces V2)\n  • Crazy Ivan (replaces Grenadier)\n\nPowers:\n  • Carpet Bomb\n  • Paratroopers\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Seismic Missiles\n\nBonuses:\n  • Terror Dog (20% discount)\n  • Kirov Cluster Bombs",
