	"Game-Faction-Usa-Desc": "USA: Airborne Forces\nUnits:\n  • SEAL\n  • Nighthawk (replaces Chinook)\n  • Guardian GI (via Airdrop)\n  • Grizzly Tank (via Airdrop)\n\nPowers:\n  • Strafing Run\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Advanced Airborne Training\n\nBonuses:\n  • Airdrop Units",
